{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34328","headline":"自和次前韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"自和次前韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"命既时相背，才非世所容。\n着书粮易绝，多病药难供。\n梦爲怀山数，愁因戒酒浓。\n鸟媒呈不一，鱼寨下仍重。\n晚桁蓑兼褐，晴檐织带舂。\n着签分水味，标石认田封。\n此地家三户，何人禄万锺。\n草堂聊当贵，金穴任轻农。\n把钓竿初冷，题诗笔未慵。\n莫忧寒事晚，江上少严冬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}